[00:17.22]1. The prophets of old sought to learn of the Christ,
[00:21.32]The hope of all groaning creation.
[00:21.42]God’s spirit revealed that Messiah would come,
[00:21.42]Providing the means of salvation.
[00:21.42]The time has arrived, the Messiah now reigns,
[00:21.48]The proof of his presence is clear.
[00:21.50]How great is the favor of learning such things;
[00:24.62]Into these even angels would peer!
[00:24.62](Chorus)
[00:28.54]Our path now becomes ever brighter;
[00:29.94]We walk in the full light of day.
[00:32.60]Behold what our God is revealing;
[00:39.88]He guides us each step of the way.
[00:43.92]2. Our Lord has appointed a trustworthy slave,
[00:43.92]Through whom He gives food in due season.
[00:56.14]The light of the truth has grown brighter with time,
[00:57.52]Appealing to heart and to reason.
[00:59.52]Our path ever clearer, our steps ever firm,
[01:01.08]We walk in the brightness of day.
[01:01.08]All thanks to Jehovah, the Source of all truth,
[01:01.08]We most gratefully walk in his way.
[01:01.08](Chorus)
[01:01.08]Our path now becomes ever brighter;
[01:04.24]We walk in the full light of day.
[01:08.62]Behold what our God is revealing;
[01:14.24]He guides us each step of the way.
